%% alt: Flowchart. The screen calls fetch. A guard checks __DEV__ and the EXPO_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING flag. If off (release build) the request goes to the real API. If on with in-app mocking, an interceptor patches fetch and a handler returns JSON without a network call. If on with a base URL, the request goes to a mock server on port 4010.
